06Testing & Error Handling
Test Cases, Discovered Edge Cases & Implemented Fixes
Test Scenario	Edge Case / Failure Observed	Implemented Fix
Empty student name, topic, or answer	Pressing Enter without text risked creating unnamed sessions or sending blank turns to the API.	main.py validates if not student_name: and if not study_topic:; study_buddy.py checks if not user_input: before updating memory.
Malformed or incomplete JSON from Gemini	An AI reply missing a required key or returning wrong field types would break downstream display or scoring.	validate_ai_response verifies JSON syntax and all 6 required fields/types; validate_with_retry performs one retry and calls messages.pop() if both attempts fail.
Transient Gemini 503 server overload	Temporary API congestion raised an unhandled exception mid-quiz.	call_gemini catches "503" errors and retries up to 3 attempts with incremental backoff (3s, 6s).
Missing GEMINI_API_KEY in .env	Running the CLI without an API key configured crashed with an unclear attribute error.	create_ai_client raises a descriptive ValueError, caught gracefully by try / except handlers in study_buddy.py and main.py.
Invalid or missing past session file	Entering a non-numeric menu choice, out-of-range index, or opening a corrupted file caused a traceback.	open_past_session in session_manager.py catches ValueError, FileNotFoundError, json.JSONDecodeError, KeyError, and OSError.
