07Ethics Reflection
Academic Accuracy & Hallucination Mitigation: Generative AI models can occasionally produce inaccurate explanations or miscalculate scores. Constraint 10 in SYSTEM_PROMPT explicitly prohibits inventing academic facts, and prepare_summary_request() in summary.py supplies Python's deterministic progress counts as the authoritative scoring record so the AI cannot alter or fabricate grades.
Fairness & Supportive Pedagogy: Automated grading can discourage students if feedback is punitive or overly rigid on phrasing. Our prompts enforce encouraging, constructive explanations and provide a structured revision round at the end of the session so learners can recover from early mistakes.
Data Privacy & Credential Security: Completed sessions saved in samples/ store the student's entered name, topic, timestamp, full conversation transcript, and summary locally. Students are advised not to enter sensitive personal identifiers in chat inputs, and .env (containing GEMINI_API_KEY) is excluded from version control via .gitignore so API keys are never exposed publicly.
08Conclusion & Future Improvements
Echo Intelligent Solutions' AI Study Buddy demonstrates how multi-turn conversation memory, R-T-C-C-O prompt engineering, strict JSON schema validation with single-retry recovery, deterministic progress tracking, and local JSON session persistence combine into a reliable, modular educational assistant.

Planned Future Improvements
Cross-Session Spaced Repetition: Automatically inspect a student's most recent saved JSON archive in samples/ at session startup to prioritize unresolved topics_to_revise.
Direct Summary Persistence Hook in main.py: Wire prepare_summary_request, call_gemini(..., system_prompt=SUMMARY_PROMPT), parse_summary_response, display_summary, and save_session directly inside new_study_session() so every finished session automatically saves its dated report.
Printable Flashcard & Study Guide Export: Export missed questions, student attempts, and verified AI explanations into a clean Markdown revision handout alongside the JSON session archive.
